# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command bt
usage 1   bt [<count>]                  backtrace: the live call chain, innermost frame first
usage 2   bt reset                      forget the current chain (after a stack-manipulating routine)
usage 3   bt <cpu> [<count>|reset]      same, on another processor - `cpus` lists them

case an empty stack
target fake
covers 1-3
$ bt
out 64
Call stack empty - nothing has been called since the last reset.
status 0
action none
$ bt 4
out 64
Call stack empty - nothing has been called since the last reset.
status 0
action none
$ bt reset
out 19
Call stack cleared.
status 0
action none
$ bt gsu
out 50
gsu does not report a call stack - see `man cpus`.
status 1
action none
$ bt cop
out 50
gsu does not report a call stack - see `man cpus`.
status 1
action none
$ bt cpu
out 64
Call stack empty - nothing has been called since the last reset.
status 0
action none
$ bt zz
out 46
Error: Could not find any recognizable digits.
status 1
action none
end

case a bare target
target bare
covers 1
$ bt
out 39
This core does not report a call stack.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ bt gsu
out 39
This core does not report a call stack.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ bt
out 58
No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
end

case on venus
target venus
covers 1,3
$ bt
out 64
Call stack empty - nothing has been called since the last reset.
status 0
action none
$ bt 2
out 64
Call stack empty - nothing has been called since the last reset.
status 0
action none
$ bt cop
out 61
This cartridge has no coprocessor to report a call stack for.
status 1
action none
end

